  "description": "Three colourful horse seats stand on the round platform of the Horse Merry-Go-Round. Each child straddles a horse and holds on as the platform turns, which feels like a small fairground ride. It suits the 3 to 6 years Key User Group and seats three. At 4' across, it is one of our more compact merry-go-rounds, and it needs a safe play area of 10' in diameter. That makes it a good option for a nursery, a play school or a small society garden. The horses come in multi colour. Galvanised pipes and roto-moulded parts are covered by our 3-year warranty, and bearings by 1 year. Share your site size and we will show it on a layout drawing.",
